WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.534
I'M TELLING YOU,
IT'S TOTALLY LEGAL.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.069
THESE DOCTORS,
THEY'LL PRESCRIBE

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:05.171
MEDICAL MARIJUANA
TO ANYONE, MAN.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:06.806
- WHAT DO I TELL THEM
I NEED IT FOR?

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.708
- IT DOESN'T MATTER.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.276
THEY WANT TO GIVE YOU
A PRESCRIPTION.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:12.111
IT'S HOW THEY GET PAID.

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:15.214
JUST MAKE SOMETHING UP.

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:16.449
- HEY, MR. WASHINGTON,
WELCOME.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.151
- HEY, DOCTOR.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.419
- ALL RIGHT, I'M GOING
TO ASK YOU A COUPLE QUESTIONS,

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.219
AND THEN WE'RE--
- AIDS.

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:21.354
- WHAT?

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.823
- AIDS.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:27.093
- AIDS?
AS IN, UH--

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.830
- AS IN I GOT IT, NEED LOTS
OF WEED TO GET RID OF IT.

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.232
- OH, OKAY, AIDS.

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.301
UM, WOW.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.403
ALL RIGHT, ARE YOU SURE
YOU'RE NOT SUFFERING

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:40.173
FROM ANYTHING ELSE LIKE,
YOU KNOW, BACK PAIN?

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.674
- NOPE.
- ANXIETY?

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.142
- COOL AS A CUCUMBER.

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:44.343
- HOW ABOUT INSOMNIA?

00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:47.513
- SLEEP LIKE A BABY...
WITH AIDS.

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.148
- OKAY, MR. WASHINGTON.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.783
LET'S JUST SLOW YOUR ROLL
FOR A SECOND HERE.

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:53.119
IF YOU HAD AIDS,
THEN I WOULD HAVE TO VERIFY IT

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.687
BY SEEING TEST RESULTS.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.223
WHEREAS IF YOU BACK PAIN
OR ANXIETY OR ANYTHING ELSE

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:59.358
THAT I CAN'T TEST FOR,
THEN I CAN GIVE YOU

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:01.694
THIS PRESCRIPTION
FOR CANNABIS RIGHT NOW.

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:03.096
- OH.
- UNDERSTAND?

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.597
- OH, I SEE, I GET IT.
- AWESOME.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.165
- MY BAD.
- GOOD, GOOD, GOOD.

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.067
- OKAY, SO--
- LEPROSY.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.103
- NO, NO.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.804
BECAUSE IF YOU HAD LEPROSY,
I'D HAVE TO QUARANTINE YOU.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.673
- OUCH.
- WHAT ARE YOU--NO.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.441
OKAY, I SEE
YOUR FINGER'S FALLING OFF.

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:17.677
NO, DON'T DO THAT, THOUGH.
THAT'S NOT GOING TO WORK.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.145
- SCURVY.
- NOPE.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:20.413
- RICKETS.
- WHAT? NO.

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:22.048
- CONSUMPTION.
- NO, MR. WASHINGTON.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:23.382
SOMETHING FROM
THIS CENTURY.

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:24.784
- SCHIZOPHRENIA.

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.385
[high pitched]
YOU DON'T HAVE SCHIZOPHRENIA.

00:01:26.418 --> 00:01:27.587
YES, YOU DO.
- KEEP IT SIMPLE.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.555
PLEASE.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:31.624
WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THAT IS.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.192
- THERE'S A FISH HOOK
IN MY LIP.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:34.360
- JUST PICK SOMETHING
OFF THIS LIST.

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:35.495
- I CAN'T REACH IT.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.529
- WHY NOT?

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:39.532
- PARALYZED.

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:41.134
- DOES YOUR FACE HURT,
MR. WASHINGTON?

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.101
- YEAH.

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:44.137
- THEN THIS SHOULD HELP.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.170
[buzzer]

